flowchart TD
  U[Parent Pi] --> A[agent_run]
  U --> W[workflow_start]
  A --> F[Foreground]
  A --> B[Detached runner]
  W --> C[Detached coordinator]
  C --> N[workflow_nodes]
  N --> G{Scheduler}
  G -->|read-only| RO[Batch max 5 concurrent]
  G -->|write| WR[Writer alone plus 2 review slots]
  F --> R[Shared runAgent]
  B --> R
  RO --> R
  WR --> R
  R --> P[Isolated Pi child]
  P --> X[Direct result]
  P --> D[Node report]
  D --> Q[Coordinator adds retries and reviews]
  Q --> N
  Q --> Z[Final result.md]
